The dish looks like a white plate about 22-24 cm across, holding a pile of diced tomato salsa (pico de gallo) with some pineapple or mango chunks. The pile is roughly 12 cm across and about 2-3 cm high, so it holds about 150 g of salsa.

Salsa runs about 30-40 kcal per 100 g. Fruit chunks add a little, so I'll use about 40 kcal per 100 g, which gives roughly 60 kcal.

